@startuml
title B — Main path: durable workflow and persisted delivery Signal
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 210
participant "Bank service" as Bank
participant "API + Outbox Relay" as API
database "Application ledger" as DB
queue "Kafka" as K
participant "Workflow Starter" as Starter
participant "Temporal Server\n+ durable persistence" as T
participant "Delivery worker\nworkflow role" as W
participant "Delivery worker\nactivity role" as A
participant "Push provider" as P
participant "Customer app" as App
participant "Receipt API\n+ Signal Relay" as R
Bank -> API: POST with stable business key
API -> DB: Commit notification + outbox (sync replica)
API --> Bank: 202 accepted
API -> K: Relay committed critical.requested
K -> Starter: critical.requested
Starter -> DB: Check notification exists and is not terminal
Starter -> T: StartWorkflow critical/<notification_id>
T --> Starter: Persisted / already exists
Starter -> K: Commit offset
T -> W: Workflow task: route resolved via activity
W -> T: Persist timer at accepted_at + 2 s\nand schedule send activity asynchronously
T -> A: Logical activity task delivery (worker polls)
A -> DB: Check deadline/evidence; create/reuse attempt; permit
DB --> A: Same attempt key across retries
A -> P: Send push (HTTP timeout <=1 s)
P --> A: Accepted + provider ID
A -> DB: Record accepted if not terminal
A -> T: Activity completion
note over T,W: Workflow waits on activity result, Signal and durable timer.\nACK may arrive before activity completion; timer is already armed.
P -> App: Deliver notification to app
App -> R: Authenticated application ACK
R -> DB: Commit receipt + terminal evidence + Signal outbox
R --> App: Receipt persisted
R -> T: Delivery Signal (receipt_id, notification_id)
T -> W: Workflow task: process deduplicated Signal
W -> T: Schedule finalize activity
T -> A: Finalize task
A -> DB: Idempotently finalize audit / check evidence
A -> T: Activity result
T -> W: Resume workflow
W -> T: Complete workflow DELIVERED
note over DB,T: Ledger holds delivery truth; Temporal holds execution history.\nOutbox and reconciliation bridge their non-atomic boundary.
@enduml
